ber: There you go. How''s that?  —  হয়ে গেছে। কেমন লাগছে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: That looks good. Thank you.  —  ভালো লাগছে। ধন্যবাদ।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৪ — ফার্মেসিতে (At the Pharmacy)"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"English"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বাংলা উচ্চারণ"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বাংলা অর্থ"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Do you have paracetamol?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ডু ইউ হ্যাভ প্যারাসিটামল"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"প্যারাসিটামল আছে?"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I have a headache."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"আই হ্যাভ অ্যা হেডেইক"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"আমার মাথাব্যথা করছে"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Can you suggest something for fever?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ক্যান ইউ সাজেস্ট সামথিং"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"জ্বরের জন্য কিছু বলবেন?"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How many times a day should I take it?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"হাউ মেনি টাইমস অ্যা ডেই"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"দিনে কতবার খাব?"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Is this safe for children?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ইজ দিস সেইফ ফর চিলড্রেন"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এটা বাচ্চাদের জন্য নিরাপদ?"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Do I need a prescription?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ডু আই নীড অ্যা প্রেসক্রিপশন"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কি প্রেসক্রিপশন লাগবে?"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How much is this?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"হাউ মাচ ইজ দিস"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এটার দাম কত?"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪.১ Dialogue — ওষুধ কেনা"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Do you have something for a headache?  —  মাথাব্যথার জন্য কিছু আছে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pharmacist: Yes, we have paracetamol. Do you have a fever too?  —  হ্যাঁ, প্যারাসিটামল আছে। জ্বরও আছে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: A little. I have been feeling unwell since morning.  —  একটু। সকাল থেকে ভালো লাগছে না।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pharmacist: Take one tablet after meals, twice a day.  —  খাবারের পর একটা করে, দিনে দুইবার খাবেন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: How much is it?  —  দাম কত?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pharmacist: It is 30 taka for a strip.  —  এক পাতা ৩০ টাকা।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: If it does not get better, should I see a doctor?  —  যদি ভালো না হয়, ডাক্তার দেখাব?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pharmacist: Yes, see a doctor if it continues for more than two days.  —  হ্যাঁ, দুই দিনের বেশি চললে ডাক্তার দেখান।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৬ — আজকের হোমওয়ার্ক"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✍️ ৩০ মিনিটের কাজ"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. চারটি Dialogue প্রতিদিন একটি করে মুখস্থ করো।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. দরদামের ৫টি কৌশল-বাক্য মুখস্থ করো — পরের বার সত্যিই বাজারে ব্যবহার করো।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. বাসায় কারো সাথে \"বিক্রেতা-ক্রেতা\" খেলা খেলো — শুধু ইংরেজিতে।"}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ তুমি বুঝবে কীভাবে যে Lesson 30 শেষ? যদি তুমি বাস্তব বাজারে গিয়ে সত্যিই একবার ইংরেজিতে দাম জিজ্ঞেস করতে পারো — এমনকি নিজের কাছে অদ্ভুত লাগলেও — তাহলে Lesson 30 তোমার হয়ে গেছে। আসল ভাষা শেখা এখানেই শুরু হয়।"}]}]}]}'::jsonb, 'published', 'intermediate', 55, now())
